          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "testimonial": "<p>Being a Delhi person we were often sold Karnataka mangoes in the name of Alphonso mangoes. After ordering mangoes from here, my whole perspective has been changed about mangoes & Alphonso. The sweetness and aroma is the thing which you will fall in love about these mangoes from maharashtra.</p>",
